<title>JAPAN: MOF likely to offer T-bills on June 5 -- traders.</title>
<headline>MOF likely to offer T-bills on June 5 -- traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry is likely to offer six-month Treasury Bills (T-bills) through a price-competitive auction on June 5, bond traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The issue amount is likely to be 1.3 trillion yen, they said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
